</figure>
<figure class="ltx_table" id="S7.T6">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table"><span class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Table 6</span>: </span><span class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Complete results on all 21 tasks in the 128k subset of LV-Eval. All sliding window-based methods use a lossless memory of 32768 tokens, consisting of 128 attention sinks and a 32640-token sliding window.</span></figcaption>
<div class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_center ltx_transformed_outer" style="width:345.0pt;height:263pt;vertical-align:-130.0pt;"><span class="ltx_transformed_inner" style="transform:translate(-121.1pt,92.3pt) scale(0.587552567755432,0.587552567755432) ;">
<table class="ltx_tabular ltx_align_middle">
<tr class="ltx_tr">
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_border_tt">Model</td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_border_tt">Dataset</td>
